description:
My client is looking for a Front-end Web Developer with an eye for clean design to join our client’s team. Our ideal candidate will be an excellent communicator, forward thinker, and a team player. The individual must take great pride in their creative work and be comfortable working in a fast-paced environment.
 You will work in collaboration with their development team to transform designs into an eye-catching and user-friendly web portal. This is a hands-on position where you will be responsible for maintaining and adding features to their SaaS portal.

 Requirements:
 B.S. in Computer Science or related field;
 3+ years of experience as a front-end developer;
 Strong hands-on experience with AngularJS and NodeJS;
 Experience with single-page application and MEAN stack;
 Strong knowledge of HTML5 and CSS3;
 Extensive experience with SASS and Compass;
 Solid understanding of cross-browser/platform issues and solution(s) for responsive/adaptive scenarios;
 GIT (version control);       
 Bonus Points: Not Required
 Experience integrating major third-party APIs (Facebook Open Graph, Twitter, Google Maps, YouTube, Open Social, etc.) is a big plus;
 Strong understanding of usability and accessibility issues is a plus;
 Experience developing for mobile devices is a plus;
 Enterprise development experience is a plus.

 All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines.
